222:     $('view-alchemy').innerHTML = `${subHead('THE HERBALIST’S COURT', 'Alchemy pavilion', 'Trade spirit stones for useful elixirs and carefully prepared tonics.', '⚗')}<div class="subview-layout"><div class="subview-main"><article class="content-panel"><div class="eyebrow">RECIPES IN YOUR JOURNAL</div><h2>Simple preparations</h2><p>Gather ingredients on expeditions, then spend spirit stones to prepare each recipe. Ingredients are consumed when a brew succeeds.</p><div class="alch-grid">${items}</div></article></div><aside class="subview-aside"><article class="content-panel"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR SATCHEL</div><h2>Carried resources</h2><div class="inventory-row"><span>Spirit stones</span><b>◇ ${nfmt(state.stones)}</b></div><div class="inventory-row"><span>Herbs</span><b>${state.herbs.herb}</b></div><div class="inventory-row"><span>Ironroot</span><b>${state.herbs.root}</b></div><div class="inventory-row"><span>Moonflower</span><b>${state.herbs.flower}</b></div><div class="inventory-row"><span>Permanent elixirs</span><b>${Math.round(state.boosts * 100)}% qi</b></div><div class="inventory-row"><span>Brews prepared</span><b>${state.brews || 0}</b></div></article><article class="feature-card"><div class="eyebrow">HERBALIST’S ADVICE</div><h3>Every root has a nature</h3><p>Use a Qi-Gathering Pill when you are close to a threshold, or save your stones to strengthen your permanent arts.</p></article></aside></div>`;
